nts: its assignments, newest first, with the start of each report; ticket/<id>/inputs: its inputs, newest first; ticket/<id>/result: its latest report; ticket/<id>/report/<id>: the report of one of its assignments; ticket/<id>/transcript: its Executor Session's messages, newest first; ticket/<id>/message/<n>: one message of that transcript; ticket/<id>/input/<id>: one input it was delivered; trigger/<id>: a trigger's text, where it went, the message it replies to and the messages around it on its thread; settings: settings by block, each with the revision a save names: the small blocks whole, the Policy and the Source instances summarized; settings/<block>: one settings block whole, as orchestrator_settings_save takes it: policy, eval, executor, pause or source:<id>; prompts: the prompt revision each Session reads, the skills, and the saved versions; prompts/<revision>: one prompt version by number, or current, the one the Session works under; prompts/defaults: the built-in prompt configuration, and the built-in parts by the key an override names; prompt-preview/<id>: a composed prompt that orchestrator_prompts_save previewed; models: model providers, the DSH default and each role's model; models/<provider>: one provider's models; feishu/<trigger-id>/…: a Feishu original, as the dsh-superagent-feishu skill describes; github/…: a GitHub original, as the dsh-superagent-github skill describes."), "minLength": Number(1), "type": String("string")}}, "required": Array [String("resource")], "type": String("object")}}, "type": String("function")}, Object {"function": Object {"description": String("Send an answer to a human question, a ready result, or attention requiring human action, as the replies section says; the gate refuses anything else, such as progress. purpose=result needs a ticket in person/review after a ready report, a completed or merged one, or a dropped one whose matched rule asks for a closing message. IM limit: 100 words."), "name": String("orchestrator_re